TI  - The political and electoral take-off of the Communist Party in recent Chile (1990-2024)
T2  - IZQUIERDAS
M3  - Article
AB  - This article explores the take-off of the Communist Party of Chile (PC) in both the political and electoral spheres. The influence of the CP within social organizations and how it is related to its arrival in state organs is described. Polls, electoral and social data were also used to analyse his sympathetic base. It was discovered that although the PC manages to sympathize with those who identify as lower class, the data reveal that it has better votes in less poor and urbanized areas.
